# Credence band/decimal INCONSISTENCY fixture. A claim asserts the
# gmeow:credenceCertain band ([0.9, 1.0]) but carries a numeric
# gmeow:claimCredence of 0.3 — squarely in the credencePossible range.
# gmeow:CredenceBandConsistencyShape MUST fire sh:Violation: the qualitative
# band is the authoritative projection key, and a decimal that contradicts it
# is malformed (the decimal is advisory finer-grained detail, never a second,
# conflicting truth).

@prefix ex:    <https://example.org/shapes/> .
@prefix gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/> .

ex:over-claimed
    gmeow:claimCredenceLevel gmeow:credenceCertain ;
    gmeow:claimCredence 0.3 .
